Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Al! Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This chromium-molybdenum steel spanner set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the hydraulic torque wrench, and that micrometer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and pick me out whichever ultra-hard tip drill and bit you think is suitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what you'd expect to\Nfind in a tool store in Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their selection is far different\Nfrom what's out in the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't get over how good the walnut handle on this screwdriver feels under my fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, are you still buying things, Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is a bit much in the way of souvenirs for your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you said you'd buy me anything, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:39.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are high-carbon chromium-steel cutting pliers, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.37,0:00:45.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll cut through anything and never rust!\NCan I buy these as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mister!\NWould you throw in this sewing machine oil too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without me around, make sure you take care of your Automail!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col. Mustang wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mission for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you're a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be called upon to go on missions, \Nso be ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Hawkeye?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here are your orders and materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The above-mentioned is hereby ordered to inspect the coal mine at Youswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stuff like this is the job of a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It includes investigating the mined resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As an alchemist, you have knowledge of ores, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your first mission, so I arranged for your task to be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't let yourself get careless just because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:06.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:12.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost like the whole train was reserved, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Traveling by train is nice, huh? All you have to do is sit, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my job, now that\NI'm a dog of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to come along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll always be together\Nwith you, Brother! After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're coming back to the village sometime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we're not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, there's no longer any home for us to return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:39.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's coming into view!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the last town to the east,\NYouswell Coal Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a coal mine, I thought there'd be more activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone looks burned-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like there's much to see here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let's do this inspection quickly and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oww!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you tourists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?!\NHave you eaten? Where are you staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pop! We've got visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visitors! Visitors!\NSome big spenders are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big spenders?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the inn's manager, Halling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry the place is so dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coal mine's wages are pretty low.\NBut with this place,\NI've got two irons in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, overnight\Naccommodations for two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are your rates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:36.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're steep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite how we look, we have plenty of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?! Don't be ridiculous!\NThat much for just a night's stay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ours is the highest-class inn in all of Youswell, such that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's the same price no matter where you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't had any guests in a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to soak you good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry had us buy all of those presents for her grandma, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else we can do.\NAt this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! It's the way it used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:14.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks brand-new!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else I can fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, if I could ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something I hold dear, but accidentally broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you still haven't thrown that away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You so rarely buy me anything, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let me handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's pretty nice, Hostess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How delightful! To think that our first guest in so long would be an alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took a crack at it once too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I didn't have the talent for it, so I gave it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, what did you come to Youswell for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here for anyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here on business.\NI came to inspect the coal mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An inspection?\NYou're with the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am... a State Alchemist, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt! What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any food or beds to give to any dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a soldier too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got nothing to do with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just got together on the train here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go get yourself eaten by dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was some incredible hatred, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure it was! Everyone hates military people, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy Yoki, who supervises this place, is a fiend for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:38.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, he's joined by that State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Alchemist, be thou for the People."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's both common sense to them, and their pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I've come to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand those who sell their souls to the military in exchange for special privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, you could worry about the \Nhuman part instead of the machine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,once in a while too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She does worry about you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I snuck this out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't eat, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soldiers really are despised, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm prepared for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should get certified too, \Nas a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough that I have to go through this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I really have become a dog of the military, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your shop is as filthy as ever, Halling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:52.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't Lt. Yoki.\NWelcome to my decrepit establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough pleasantries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The taxes on your place are overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:09:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you, I could say the same for the whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize. My earnings are so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is because your work is so poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who lowered our wages, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you raised our taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki has been placed in charge of this coal mine by Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You just took the money that we sweat bullets to earn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and used it to bribe them to promote you, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph! So why don't you try offering tribute to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world is not a place where everything is provided for you on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastard! I can't put up \Nwith any more of this today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that the stories of this shop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,becoming a hangout for troublemakers have turned out to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:58.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will have to think about suspending your business license.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make an example of him. Hurt him just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:11.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard the Lieutenant would be coming by,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this kid, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You don't even\Nknow about State Alchemists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're an organization under \Nthe direct control of the Führer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:41.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, how terribly\Nrude of my subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Yoki, the one who runs this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, what business might you have in coming to our rural town?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just here to conduct an inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only you had contacted me,\NI would've sent someone to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come, come, please stay at my mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miserable dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Congratulations, Mustang-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I hear you're going to\Nbecome a full colonel soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye-kun, I hear you're going to be promoted to 1st Lieutenant too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder, once your authority increases,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you would go to the Eastern Command\NCenter and take charge of it for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're demoting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92}I suppose having someone like me around Central does—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't a demotion. It's a transfer to a higher post, {\i1}Colonel{\i0} Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I've heard there are a good number of untrustworthy folks in the Eastern Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure to watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am greatly honored that a State Alchemist \Nshould come visit my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since we have such an exceptional alchemist among us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, have him take\Na look at your alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:52.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I saw it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She liquefied the air around her,\Nreduced its volume,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and then all at once vaporized it again,\Nproducing a shockwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The light came from the extreme heat that was created by the forced compression, to maintain entropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You figured all that out\Nwith just a glance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, too, would like to be certified as a State Alchemist\Nand become like you, Edward-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is my dream to become an outstanding alchemist, \Nand do all that I can for the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, please feel free to eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope that our rural cooking will agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You eat well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite the town being in this shape...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you embarrass me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tax collecting has not been going well,\Nand I don't know\Nwhat I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of that, there are so many \Nbarbaric residents here, as you saw earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:46.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, all they do is assert their rights and neglect their duty to pay their taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:50.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, indeed, Edward-sama,\Nyou are a man of understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can express all the reasoning of the world\Nin terms of equivalent exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the basis of alchemy, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rights come with responsibilities, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:03.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Certainly! Mm, most wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, I wonder if you would accept this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by way of the reasoning of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is only a small token.\NPlease accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what you would call a bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's far too direct a way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, call it an equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if you would please consider the matter of the inspection...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have known that you would be so understanding, Edward-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks in town should start\Nbehaving themselves soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so if you would care to wait briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Brother is all right on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Khayal is still in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't, boss! It's too dangerous!\NThere's no telling when it'll collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this their doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, you're a cracker-jack alchemist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, transmute some gold for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you can help my pop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could save the whole town for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?! You don't lose anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The basis of alchemy is equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have neither the duty nor the obligation to do anything for this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you telling us to bribe you as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself an alchemist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Alchemist, be thou for the People," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmuting gold is a serious offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:23.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I get caught, I'll be stripped of\Nmy State Alchemist certification,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and sent to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, do it so no one finds out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:30.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I do make gold, it'll just be taken in taxes, and that'll be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:32.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're really that hard up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why don't you leave this town and go find some other work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you may not understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but this place is our home, and our coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your home and coffin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, we burned down our home ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to return to,\Nand that's all right by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for people who do have somewhere they call home,\Nthey have to look out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, what you see here will be our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to buy the coal mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to include everything from the mine to the trade routes.\NIs that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.23,0:16:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... even at the request of a State Alchemist, that's just something I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I got all this money ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all gold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Upon investigation, \Nit turns out that this mine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,had unexploited elements that we use in alchemy research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to turn it\Nover to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, my selling the mine that\NI was entrusted by the state to govern
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for my own profit will look a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:09.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right! This gold doesn't appear on any records,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so as long as you keep your lips sealed,\Nyou can get by without anyone else knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please write up a memo handing over all authority over the coal mine for no charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing that, this will be\Nall yours, Lieutenant Yoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just am! I will not allow you to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they were the ones who demolished the store!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just one store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody! I'm here to cheer up\Nthose gloomy faces of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, is that any way to \Ntalk to the manager of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager?! Why, you!\NWhat have you—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, this is the title deed for the mining, trade, management,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and all other rights\Nto this coal mine.\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, right now,\Nthis coal mine belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:07.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to go back to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be a nuisance to have to\Ncarry this title deed back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Ntrying to sell that to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll cost an arm and a leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever you wish to gain anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you have to pay for it with something of appropriate value, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, not only is this title deed written on high-grade parchment,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it also has gold leaf trim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, the box\Nfeatures finely crushed jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:36.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in a nonchalant yet luxurious design.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is real craftsmanship, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and the key is made of sterling silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gee, I would roughly estimate that it's worth 200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?! For the deed to the coal mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?!\NThat's all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, the foreman's inn\Ncost 200,000, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about I spend the night and we call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent exchange, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But our inn has been...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well then,\Nwhat's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can this be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This will be enough to\Ncover me staying here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then it's an equivalent exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gold bars that I got from you\Nhave all turned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gold bars? Why, whatever are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I traded you that title deed\Nfor a mountain of gold bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You handed over the deed free of charge, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I even have the memo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You swindled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Swindled" makes it sound so scandalous. It was a legitimate transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transaction is invalid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.31,0:20:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemist, be thou for the People!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.19,0:20:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't much care for you using\Nalchemy for your own interests!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a State Alchemist, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you go against what the military is doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never sold my soul to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the title deed back from—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take other people's personal property from them by force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never underestimate the strength of a coal mining man, Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saké! Saké! Bring us some saké!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, honey, isn't the shop\Na little better than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He really did a number here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric, the Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the report from Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear this will provide the chance to reevaluate Youswell Coal Mine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the personnel at the Eastern Command Center who oversee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll probably make it\Na little easier to live out east.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rejoice! Even if we are relocated, we'll be able to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you meant for\Nthis to happen from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, it would be nice\Nif the women in the east were pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, their reputations are quickly spreading throughout the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're saying that there is a champion of the people among the dogs of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.85,0:22:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edward Elric?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah, I've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, what kind of guy is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the stories, \Ndespite being a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he's a friend to the common man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must be a fairly\Nupstanding man then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.95,0:22:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they also say he's short, like a little bean sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "miniature size"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you keep running like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll never keep up the strength to reach the town of Liore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 10: "Psiren, the Phantom Thief"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Brother, isn't it strange how there are people
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.00,0:23:49.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who you can't tell \Nwhether they're good or bad?
